    <section class="section section-alt">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow reveal">How I Work</p>
        <h2 class="reveal delay-1">Japanese restraint.<br/>Luxury in the detail.</h2>
        <p class="reveal delay-2" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">My style draws from Japanese design — restraint, calm, a considered use of negative space. Layered with a luxury sensibility built from working across residential and commercial projects. The discipline of commercial work makes residential design sharper. I bring that rigour to every brief.</p>
        <p class="reveal delay-2">What I care about is getting every decision right: the material, the proportion, the quiet detail that most people won't consciously name but would miss if it wasn't there.</p>
        <a href="about.html" class="btn mt-4 reveal delay-3">More about how I work →</a>
